OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening to come with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine, followed by a dry and clear
OL,8,Fnight. A few mist patches are possible
OL,9,Fin places, most likely through Devon
OL,10,Fand Cornwall. Feeling cool
OL,11,Fparticularly in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA dry day on Sunday and
OL,14,Ffeeling very warm in the sunny spells.
OL,15,FSome patchy cloud developing in the
OL,16,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,17,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
